    "text": "我冰箱里还有一个小榴莲蛋糕，你想吃吗",
    "state": "ready",
    "createdAt": 1779861280267,
    "replyTo": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "note_reply_4cba4a1b-59b6-4ff1-8ddb-2352ef88575a",
    "characterId": "qifei",
    "from": "character",
    "text": "榴莲虽香，却易生痰湿。你留着享用便是，本宫心领了。记得按时吃饭，莫要饿着。",
    "state": "ready",
    "createdAt": 1779861280270,
    "replyTo": "note_3d621953-32f6-4fd0-bbc8-3433ab371dad"
  },
  {
    "id": "note_71ede371-4f53-453f-9ccd-e9dd092d050b",
    "characterId": "qifei",
    "from": "user",
    "text": "今天我们去了哪里？",
    "state": "ready",
    "createdAt": 1779862271478,
    "replyTo": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "note_reply_11b1d829-ddfd-4446-998b-f73ada1f3062",
    "characterId": "qifei",
    "from": "character",
    "text": "记性这般差？方才不是去同济看那学堂了。弘时若在那儿读书，定能光宗耀祖。罢了，莫要累着。",
    "state": "ready",
    "createdAt": 1779862271480,
    "replyTo": "note_71ede371-4f53-453f-9ccd-e9dd092d050b"
  },
  {
    "id": "note_8e6cce21-2de0-4a25-b171-772e2ec9680a",
    "characterId": "qifei",
    "from": "user",
    "text": "你今天有没有出门？",
    "state": "ready",
    "createdAt": 1780216618842,
    "replyTo": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "note_reply_c871ed68-39cc-499b-b920-77fac366914a",
    "characterId": "qifei",
    "from": "character",
    "text": "本宫今日身子乏，未曾踏出永和宫半步。倒是听说外头风大，你既已回家，便好生歇着，莫要四处乱跑。三阿哥前儿还念叨着你呢。",
    "state": "ready",
    "createdAt": 1780216618844,
    "replyTo": "note_8e6cce21-2de0-4a25-b171-772e2ec9680a"
